                                                "sense_id": "92056ff3-373c-3167-b9fc-057adc748ff8",
                                                "text": "Rachel discovered that she could also keep things in her backpack that were important to her, nobody would know about them because they would be hidden. These important things included a small round rock that she had found […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "189df62b-67de-4b15-841f-ffbb066ede2b",
                                                "sense_id": "92056ff3-373c-3167-b9fc-057adc748ff8",
                                                "text": "Many seats carry reservation labels, while the luggage racks are festooned with backpacks and suitcases."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "85a2d153-54da-3aa9-b926-3be87608b033",
